    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "8C1247CA4CA11B3C",
      "text": "Wie geht’s, wie steht’s? Fangen wir direkt mit\\ndem Unterricht an.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "8C124ACA4CA12055",
      "text": "Als Nächstes steht euch die Abschlussprüfung\\nbevor. Heute ist also unsere letzte Stunde.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "8C1249CA4CA11EA2",
      "text": "Unser abschließendes Thema sind die [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Formen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nvon Pokémon! Einfacher gesagt geht es dabei\\r\\num ihr Aussehen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "8C1244CA4CA11623",
      "text": "Wenn ein Pokémon unter bestimmten\\nBedingungen seine Erscheinung ändert,\\r\\nnennt man das [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Formwechsel[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "8C1243CA4CA11470",
      "text": "Mopex zum Beispiel, auf dem viele Menschen\\nin Paldea reiten, hat drei Formen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "8C1246CA4CA11989",
      "text": "Zunächst einmal verfügt es über eine Grundform,\\nin der es auf vier Beinen läuft.\\c\\nWährend eines Kampfes nimmt es seine\\nKampfform an und steht auf zwei Beinen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "8C1245CA4CA117D6",
      "text": "Als Drittes gibt es da noch seine Reitform,\\nbei der es seinen Kehlsack und seinen Schweif\\r\\naufbläht, sodass man auf ihm reiten kann.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "8C1250CA4CA12A87",
      "text": "Dann gibt es natürlich auch noch ein gewisses\\nGerät, mit dem ihr sicherlich alle vertraut seid.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "8C124FCA4CA128D4",
      "text": "Einige eurer Handys haben doch ein Pokémon\\nim Inneren, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "8C0EC2CA4C9E0366",
      "text": "Kann mir jemand sagen, welches Pokémon\\ndas ist?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_07_select_01",
      "hash64": "F9DBB5DFA555615C",
      "text": "Rotom",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_07_select_02",
      "hash64": "F9DBB8DFA5556675",
      "text": "Pikachu",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_07_select_03",
      "hash64": "F9DBB7DFA55564C2",
      "text": "Skaraborn",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "324BC4A769C4DEED",
      "text": "Du kennst dich offenbar gut mit Technik und\\nmit Pokémon aus, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "324BC1A769C4D9D4",
      "text": "Es wäre sicherlich süß, wenn ein Pikachu in euren\\nHandys stecken würde. Bestimmt würde es uns\\r\\nganz schön herumkommandieren!\\c\\nAber das ist leider die falsche Antwort.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "324BC2A769C4DB87",
      "text": "Hahaha, nicht schlecht, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nMit seinem Horn als Antenne hätte Skaraborn\\ngewiss einige Vorteile als altmodisches Handy,\\r\\naber leider liegst du hier falsch![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "8C0EC3CA4C9E0519",
      "text": "Die richtige Antwort ist, dass in euren Handys\\nein Rotom steckt, das euch in vielerlei Hinsicht\\r\\nhelfen kann.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "8C0EC0CA4C9E0000",
      "text": "Rotom, die in einem Smart-Rotom leben,\\nsind besonders und werden in keine anderen\\r\\nelektrischen Geräte schlüpfen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "8C0EC1CA4C9E01B3",
      "text": "Ein gewöhnliches Rotom hingegen schlüpft auch\\ngerne mal in Geräte wie Waschmaschinen oder\\r\\nMikrowellen und kann so seine Form ändern.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "8C0EC6CA4C9E0A32",
      "text": "Rotom ist aber ein Ausnahmefall.\\c\\nDie meisten Pokémon ändern ihre Form nämlich\\ndurch getragene Items oder indem man ein Item\\r\\nauf sie anwendet.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "8C0EC7CA4C9E0BE5",
      "text": "Choreogel zum Beispiel kann vier verschiedene\\nFormen annehmen, je nachdem, welchen Nektar\\r\\nman ihm gibt.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "8C0EC4CA4C9E06CC",
      "text": "Es gibt auch Pokémon, die ihren Typ oder ihre\\nAttacken ändern, wenn sie ihre Form wechseln.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "8C0EC5CA4C9E087F",
      "text": "Der Formwechsel unterscheidet sich von einer\\nEntwicklung, da das Pokémon seine ursprüngliche\\r\\nGestalt wieder annehmen kann.\\c\\nAuch das Phänomen der Schillernden Pokémon\\nist leicht anders.\\c\\nIn diesem Fall hat das Pokémon lediglich eine\\nandere Farbe als seine Artgenossen, nicht aber\\r\\neine andere Form.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 286,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 307,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "8C0ECACA4C9E10FE",
      "text": "So ein Formwechsel ist schon eine spannende\\nSache![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "8C0ECBCA4C9E12B1",
      "text": "Man kann so einiges von Pokémon lernen...\\nOder über sie.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "8C0B5CCA4C9B203D",
      "text": "Ich hoffe, ihr habt hier an der Akademie viel\\nSpaß gehabt und eine Menge gelernt.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "8C0B5BCA4C9B1E8A",
      "text": "In gewisser Weise habt ihr ebenfalls einen\\nFormwechsel vollzogen! Oder auch nicht.\\r\\nHahaha![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "8C0B5ACA4C9B1CD7",
      "text": "Ach ja, fast vergessen![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_a_07_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "8C0B59CA4C9B1B24",
      "text": "Es gibt auch noch Regionalformen, die je nach\\nRegion verschieden sind.\\c\\nSie unterscheiden sich von anderen Formen,\\nda sie angeboren und unveränderl--[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
